    "content": "Description\nAdds a PDM add-in from a specified directory.\n\nSyntax\n\naddaddin -Directory\n\nParameters\n\n| Parameter | Required | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| None | No | This command has no parameters. |\n\n### Parameter Details\n\n- `Directory`: Directory that contains the add-in files.\n\nAvailability\nAvailable since PDMShell 2.0.0.",
